# Mod log

## Project
Bodycam x GTA V Legacy

## Concept
A single-player GTA V story mode modification that adds a Bodycam-style mission layer, recording HUD, and evidence-based mission loop.

## Current status
Prototype and design file created.

## Host game
GTA V Legacy, story mode only.

## Rules
- No GTA Online
- No anti-cheat bypass
- No multiplayer assumptions
- Keep it a real mod that launches from the player's GTA V install

## Next milestone
Build a minimal mission trigger, Bodycam UI, and a short objective loop that can run in GTA V story mode.
